<title>UK: Ex-Lands in talks about possible purchases.</title>
<headline>Ex-Lands in talks about possible purchases.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Ex-Lands Properties Plc said on Wednesday that it was in talks regarding possible acquisitions, but denied press speculation that it was in discussions involving a takeover of the company.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the acquisition talks, if concluded, may also include new board appointments.</p>
<p>The company said it expected any shares that might be issued as payment for these acquisitions to be issued at less than its current share price.</p>
<p>By 1248 GMT, shares in the company were down 1-3/4p at 19-1/2p.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
